&FORCE_EVAL
   METHOD QUICKSTEP
   &SUBSYS
      &KIND P
         BASIS_SET QZVPP-MOLOPT-PBE-ae
         POTENTIAL ALL
         RADIAL_GRID 50
         LEBEDEV_GRID 50
         HARD_EXP_RADIUS 1.8
