         POTENTIAL ALL
         RADIAL_GRID 100
         LEBEDEV_GRID 100
         HARD_EXP_RADIUS 1.9
      &END KIND
      &TOPOLOGY
         &CENTER_COORDINATES
         &END CENTER_COORDINATES
      &END TOPOLOGY
      &COORD
         P         0.0000000000        0.0000000000        4.0901199999
         C         0.0000000000        0.0000000000        5.6155099975
